      "displayName": "Chris Wilper",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Ae25d94d0-bd50-4c2c-906c-14cdf85801fb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "updated": "2009-10-06T14:51:20.259-0300"
    },
    {
     "author": {
      "accountId": "557058:e25d94d0-bd50-4c2c-906c-14cdf85801fb",
      "accountType": "atlassian",
      "active": true,
      "avatarUrls": {
       "16x16": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png",
       "24x24": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png",
       "32x32": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png",
       "48x48": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/f53ee0691ccb59ede3ec232c18af4e16?d=https%3A%2F%2Favatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net%2Finitials%2FCW-5.png"
      },
      "displayName": "Chris Wilper",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=557058%3Ae25d94d0-bd50-4c2c-906c-14cdf85801fb",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": {
      "content": [
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "After making several changes (now committed to trunk, to be included with Fedora 3.3 release) I was able to get this to work with SQL Server Express 2008 (WinXP/Java6/jTDS JDBC Driver v1.2.4)",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "The Fedora installer doesn't currently support this option, so it must be configured manually.  Here's how I got it working:",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "1) Install and configure SQL Server 2008 Express:",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "a) For \"sa\" (the default admin user), use \"fedoraAdmin1!\" as the password.",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "b) In the Sql Server Configuration Manager, under Network Configuration:",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "i) Enable TCP/IP",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "ii) Specify 1433 as the port for IPAll",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "c) Restart the database",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "2) Download the jTDS JDBC Driver from ",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "marks": [
           {
            "attrs": {
             "href": "http://jtds.sourceforge.net/"
            },
            "type": "link"
           }
          ],
          "text": "http://jtds.sourceforge.net/",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "3) Run the Fedora installer and select \"oracle\" (yes, oracle) as the install option.",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "Specify:",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "JDBC Driver Path: (the path to the jTDS jar you downloaded)",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "JDBC Driver Class: net.sourceforge.jtds.jdbc.Driver",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "JDBC URL: jdbc:jtds:sqlserver://localhost:1433",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "DB Username: sa",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "DB Password: fedoraAdmin1!",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "4) After the installer has run, but before starting Fedora, modify",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "$FEDORA_HOME/server/config/fedora.fcfg",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "a) Change the backslash_is_escape parameter to \"false\"",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "b) Change all occurances of localOraclePool to localMSSQLPool",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "c) Within the datastore element with id \"localMSSQLPool\":",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "i) change the validationQuery value to \"select 1\"",
          "type": "text"
         },
         {
          "type": "hardBreak"
         },
         {
          "text": "ii) remove the connection.SetBigStringTryClob parameter",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       },
       {
        "content": [
         {
          "text": "5) Start Fedora for the first time",
          "type": "text"
         }
        ],
        "type": "paragraph"
       }
      ],
      "type": "doc",
      "version": 1
     },
