     },
     "body": "<p>Resolved:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>We'll put this in trunk for 3.3 and solicit feedback on who finds it useful</li>\n\t<li>Needs to be tested in 3.3 test cycle</li>\n\t<li>Possibly will keep experimental or bring on as core supported database</li>\n</ul>\n\n\n<p>Temporary measure for now:</p>\n<ul class=\"alternate\" type=\"square\">\n\t<li>Need to find and work with fedora-create effort to make this kind of contrib easier to do in a less monolith way.</li>\n</ul>\n",
     "created": "06/Oct/09 2:51 PM",
     "id": "11016",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/10505/comment/11016",
